Padra inference engine — source attribution

The source model is JetBrains/Mellum2.1-12B-A2.5B-Thinking, revision
92ddae9fc7665e9f801d141d2e5a6b2caf2460c4. Model licensing is separate;
no original or derivative model weights are included in this repository.

Generic native/runtime/HTTP, quantization and CUDA ownership/staging mechanisms
were adapted from Danmoreng/gem16 (Apache-2.0). Server reference pin:
c0a807afcbcd2528f304bada513afd11d1e9c979. CUDA/Trellis reference pin:
c01789a2b46520df8a699ee3338cb19aaccebae2. Mellum arithmetic and its original
chat template are retained; Gemma model arithmetic/templates were not copied.

CUTLASS ABI, conversions and FP8 support use NVIDIA/CUTLASS (BSD-3-Clause),
revision db1c288993354c88e551c40c19a8fb93a774a241. External headers are pinned
and verified by CMake; their license is retained in licenses/.

EXL3/H128 quantization mechanisms derive from turboderp/exllamav3 (MIT).
The native tokenizer uses Hugging Face Tokenizers0.22.1 (Apache-2.0), with
locked Rust dependencies. Individual dependency licensing remains applicable.

HTTP transport is cpp-httplib0.40.0 (MIT); upstream license is in third_party/.
The local transport adaptation preserves bodyless framing/read-ahead and close
semantics. Source-file copyright notices and license headers are retained.
